<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,458.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,458.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,458 today from 1,460 on Feb 25, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1531    13.900	  1537    13.956</p>
<p>   1a   1470 11131.000	  1484 11238.000</p>
